graph TD
    Input[入力: Mel Spectrogram<br/>1ch × 128 freq × T frames] --> Stage1
    Emb[BEATs埋め込み<br/>768次元] --> EmbProc[埋め込み処理]
    
    subgraph Stage1[1. 特徴抽出]
        B1[Block 1<br/>1→16 filters<br/>Pool: 2×2]
        B2[Block 2<br/>16→32 filters<br/>Pool: 2×2]
        B1 --> B2
    end
    
    Stage1 --> Stage2
    
    subgraph Stage2[2. 特徴増強]
        B3[Block 3<br/>32→64 filters<br/>Pool: 1×2]
        B4[Block 4<br/>64→128 filters<br/>Pool: 1×2]
        B3 --> B4
    end
    
    Stage2 --> Stage3
    
    subgraph Stage3[3. 高次特徴]
        B5[Block 5-7<br/>128→128 filters<br/>×3層<br/>Pool: 1×2 each]
    end
    
    Stage3 --> Process
    
    subgraph Process[後処理]
        Perm[Permute<br/>周波数次元平坦化]
        EmbProc --> Concat[埋め込み統合]
        Perm --> Concat
    end
    
    Concat --> Output[出力<br/>batch × T' × 128]
    
    Note1[各Blockの構成:<br/>Conv2D → BatchNorm → ReLU → <br> Dropout 0.2 → MaxPool2D]
